# The scorecard exports are fixtures, not source. They must stay byte-identical
# to what CricClubs emits — CRLF and all — or they stop testing what the
# importer will actually be handed. Development is on Windows and the importer
# runs in a Linux container, so ostensibly harmless line-ending normalisation
# is exactly the sort of difference that hides until production.
docs/samples/*.csv -text

# Design sources are binary; never try to diff or normalise them.
*.ai binary
